  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Parliaments and Parties (WFD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will support more inclusive, accountable and open political systems in ODA-eligible countries, aiding sustainable growth and international development objectives to achieve poverty reduction.  There are four outcomes: (1) greater access and inclusion of women and under represented groups in political processes; (2) improved accountability through more robust scrutiny of government performance; (3) more transparent, open democratic institutions with increased engagement with civil society; and (4), stronger evidence about effectiveness of democratic support in different political contexts to inform delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
